Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:07.18,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,5100,5720)\pos(640,358.666)}Episode 26
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:07.18,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,5100,5720)\pos(640,516)}Returning to Recommend Zhūgě
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:01:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't until meeting you that my horizons broadened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Never did I expect our time together would be so short.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is overwhelmed with grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:48.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,5200,5700)\pos(307.715,495.466)}Liú Bèi\N Styled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorely deprived of the fate to spend more time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you will serve the new Lord well, so that you will achieve status and fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am but a man with little talent, yet you regarded me so highly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's unfortunate parting is for my elderly mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:14.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,7200,7600)\pos(584.469,422.133)}Xú Shù \NStyled: Yuánzhí
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Cao Cao threatens me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,, I shall never, for the rest of my life, offer a single plan for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After you have gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,, I shall also hide myself deep within the mountains and woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With my mother in distress, my state of mind is in turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.74,0:02:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I stayed, I wouldn't be able to improve the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord should find another talented and virtuous man to assist you in achieving your great cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord should not be so discouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Among all the able men under the heavens, I am afraid none can compete with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I, a mediocre man, be deserving of such high praise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope all your officers will serve the Lord well
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,so that your names are recorded in silk and your achievements go down in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My work will remain incomplete, you should not follow after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please return, my Lord, and take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I send you off for a 1,000 {\i1}li,{\i0} farewells are unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Attendants! Attendants! Cut down all those trees over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:43.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(300.44,500.146)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They are preventing me from seeing Yuanzhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They are hindering my view.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:04.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(930.132,496.055)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have returned, can it be that you will not go to Xudu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In my turmoil, I forgot a thing of utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Out there is an ingenious man,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,who resides in Lóngzhōng, \Ntwenty {\i1}li{\i0} from the city of Xiangyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not seek for his assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is reduced to ashes with your departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words are incorrect, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you remain this way then I will make my leave with a heart of stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Never looking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What I said was indeed words of my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I naturally know of my lord's heart of benevolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But uttering such words while your great cause is incomplete,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,will only disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are numerous talented men above me. I am neither jesting nor being humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire ought to seek after them for achieving your great cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I will trouble you to invite him to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This man cannot be recruited with such informalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord must go seek him in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If sire were successful,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be like the Zhōu gaining Lü Wàng, or the Hàn gaining Zhāng Liáng!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:28.18,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Lǚ Wàng AKA. Jiāng Zǐyá was the strategist who helped establish the Zhōu Dynasty.\N Zhāng Liáng was the strategist who helped establish the Hàn Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How does this man compare with mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}If you are to compare me with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545} it is like comparing a frail horse with a qilin, or a jackdaw with a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}This man compares himself with{\i1} Guǎn Zhòng{\i0} and{\i1} Yuè Yì,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:49.02,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Guǎn Zhòng and Yuè Yì are two of the greatest philosopher-statesmen and generals of the Spring and Autumn and Warring States period respectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}he has the ability to sew Heaven and Earth together, a genius who looms over all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}I wish to know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}This man is from {\i1}Yángdū{\i0} of {\i1}Lángyá commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:08:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}Of the family {\i1}"Zhūgě,"{\i0} \Nby the name of {\i1}"Liàng,"{\i0} styled{\i1} Kǒngmíng.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}He lives on a ridge of hills called {\i1}Wolong Hillock,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:07.02,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Literally "Sleeping Dragon Hillock"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545} which is why he calls himself,\N{\i1} the Sleeping Dragon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}If you have this man's assistance you will have no worries about securing the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}Could he be the one from when people speak of \N{\i1}Sleeping Dragon {\i0}and{\i1} Fledgling Phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Fledgling Phoenix is {\i1}Páng Tǒng{\i0} from Xiāngyáng.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}That Sleeping Dragon is indeed Zhuge Kongming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.18,0:08:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}Today I finally know who \NSleeping Dragon and Fledgling Phoenix are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.46,0:08:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}I did not expect them to be right before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}If not for Mister's words, I would remain blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}I will take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}With this departure, we are now separated by the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}I wonder when we might meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:21.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In order to weaken Liu Bei's influence and gain the capable man for his own use,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:25.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao schemed to lure Xu Shu into Xudu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:31.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After turning back 10 li to recommend Zhuge Liang to Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:37.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Xu Shu took a detour to meet Zhuge Liang in Nanyang to tell him of his recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:47.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Having sent Xu Shu away, Liu Bei prepared to visit Zhuge Liang along with Guan Yu and Zhang Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310.572,360)}Mother of Xu Shu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, please forgive your impious son for arriving late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My son!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you come to Xudu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I was assisting Lord Liu in Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I received your letter calling for me, so I rushed here through night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when did I write a letter to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:11:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This... this is not my letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How muddled you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After you have roamed the world for so many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,, I would think your learning had progressed, but you have regressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My son, you are an educated man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,, you know you can only fulfill either filial piety and loyalty, not both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you not see that Cao Cao deceives and insults the Dynasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Xuande's compassion stretches across the whole realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, he is also a kinsman of \Nthe House of Hàn! You were assisting him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You were serving a noble lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, because of a scrap of forged letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you left the light for darkness! You tarnish your own name!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My son,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,how can I even look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:13:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have brought disgrace upon our family!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there is nothing left for you in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.82,0:13:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Third brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the gifts have all been prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can now go to Wolong Hillock to visit Mister Zhuge Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should you trouble yourself? Just send me and Second Brother if you are concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Zhuge Liang is a sagacious prodigy of our time. I must go in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Elder Brother! Third Brother and I will go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can leave the matters here with Zilong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:14:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, there is a gentleman outside. He is wearing a wide belt,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,has the shape of a pine and the frame of a crane, and he wishes to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Sir Kongming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the main gate and invite him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Shuijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since leaving you, I have been preoccupied with military affairs and couldn't visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arrival today comforts my longing heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard that Yuanzhi is here, so I have come to see him in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi has left for Xudu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi hates Cao Cao the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he go to Xudu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao imprisoned his mother and she wrote a letter for him to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yuanzhi left for Xudu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He was tricked! That was a trap of Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a seat to talk, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have known that his mother is a honorable woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:23.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\bord6\fade(255,0,255,0,420,5200,5920)\pos(963.954,496.055)}Sīmǎ Huī\NStyled: Décāo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she was imprisoned, she would never write a letter to tell her son to follow Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This letter must have been forged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yuanzhi didn't go, his mother would live,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but if he did go, she will definitely die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:16:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She is a woman of high principles with a deep hatred for Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But also, she has a fierce personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.74,0:16:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Having witnessed her son abandon the light for darkness, she must feel ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She will die for honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She lived upholding it, and will die for it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish man Yuanzhi is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fool he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:36.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After Xu's mother hanged herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:41.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao led both his military and civil officials to commemorate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:46.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Xu Shu buried his mother in Nanyuan of Xudu and kept vigil at her tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:51.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,As long as the gift was from Cao Cao, Xu Shu would firmly reject them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:57.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and secretly vowed to never come up with any strategem for Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:59.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to keep his promise to Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he parted, he recommended Zhuge Liang from Nanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this man like, sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yuanzhi went, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.90,0:17:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But why should he ask Zhuge Liang to spit blood, sweat, and tears?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}Kongming is a close friend with Cui Zhouping, Shi Guang,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545} Meng Gongwei, and Xu Yuanzhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}The talents of these four men surpass many.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Only Kongming has \Nsuperior talent and mind for strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}He once joked to the four that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}they would be governors and prefects if they went into politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}The four then asked where his ambitions lay,\N but he laughed without answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}He regularly compared himself with Guǎn Zhòng and Yuè Yì.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}His talents cannot be measured!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.02,0:18:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Mister Shuijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Though I am no scholar, I have read\N the {\i1}Spring and Autumn Annals.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Guǎn Zhòng and Yuè Yì were two of\N the greatest men of the Eastern Zhōu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Their achievements were above all in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}For Kongming to compare himself with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)\bord12.545}... is that not too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}In my opinion, he not only can compare with these two,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}he can also be compared with two other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Oh? Which two?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Jiang Ziya, who gave rise to the 800 years of Zhōu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}and Zhāng Zǐfáng who helped found the 400 years of Hàn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the general is busy, I should not disturb him and will make my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, to be frank, I was just about visit Wolonggang to seek Mister Kongming with my two brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Although the Sleeping Dragon has found his lord, he has not been born in the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pity, oh what a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a true wise hermit, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:21.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}The sky is like a round lid, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:29.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}The earth is like a qi-board, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:40.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Humans are split into \Nblack and white game pieces, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:49.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}They struggle for glory and honor, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:55.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}The victors are naturally at peace, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:21:02.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}While the losers labor, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:08.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}There is a hermit in Nanyang, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:21.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}He sleeps but does not rest enough, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:28.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}The sky is like a round lid, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:37.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}The earth is like a qi-board, {\i1}oh...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:42.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}This ballad sees through the rise and fall of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.66,0:21:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}I wonder who composed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:53.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545\i1}...They struggle for glory and honor, oh!{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:58.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}The victors are naturally at peace, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:05.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}While the losers labor, oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a song pleasing to the ears from the field with elegant and deep verses,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,, and would dare to ask, who is it composed by?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It was composed by Mister Wolong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does Mister Sleeping Dragon reside?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.98,0:22:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go south along this path and you will reach Wolong Hillock.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There is a hut among the bamboo groves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's where Mister Sleeping Dragon resides.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.18,0:22:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful place!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is knocking at the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.98,0:24:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pass on that {\i1}Hàn General of \Nthe Left,{\i0} {\i1}Marquis of Yicheng District{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.02,0:24:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,, {\i1}Potentate candidate of Yù Province,{\i0} \NImperial Uncle Liu Bei, is here to visit Mister Zhuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.02,0:24:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So wordy, I can't remember that many titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.50,0:25:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then simply tell him that \NLiu Bei has come to seek him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.14,0:25:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher already left this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.62,0:25:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where has he gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,His journey is uncertain. I don't know where he has gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.18,0:25:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When will he return?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.74,0:25:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That is uncertain, could be three, five, or a dozen days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.42,0:25:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother, since he's not here, why not return?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.54,0:25:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wait a while more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.34,0:25:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.86,0:25:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The page already said that\N the return date is uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.50,0:25:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go back for now, and later send for someone to find out when he will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.74,0:25:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can visit him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.66,0:25:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When your teacher returns, please tell him about Liu Bei's visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.62,0:25:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take these gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.98,0:25:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take the gifts, but I will remember your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.30,0:26:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That man holds himself well, he must be Sir Wolong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.94,0:27:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, are you Sleeping Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.38,0:27:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Kongming's friend, {\i1}Cui Zhouping {\i0}of {\i1}Boling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.34,0:27:18.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,5000,5420)\pos(986.354,391.055)}Cuī \NZhōupìng
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.58,0:27:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard of your name, and am honored to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we please have a seat, I would like to inquire about some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.34,0:27:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.86,0:27:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.66,0:27:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you wish to see Kongming?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.22,0:27:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is now in turmoil, and warfare is constant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.78,0:27:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come to visit Mister Sleeping Dragon for a plan to pacify and reform the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.02,0:27:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.02,0:28:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545}Eh, though sir seeks to pacify, while with kindness, chaos is but a constant since ancient times.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.14,0:28:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545} Untouched by the strength of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.90,0:28:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}If you seek to ask Kongming to take the stage, \Nto restore the Hàn dynasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.54,0:28:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}I'm afraid it will be a wasted effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.62,0:28:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{{\bord12.545} General must know that those who follow Heaven live in harmony, while those who defy it fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.70,0:28:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,664.788)}{\bord12.545}How could men oppose the natural order of things?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.58,0:28:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words do carry insight,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.18,0:28:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,yet, as a kinsman of the House of Hàn, I should be restoring the Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.46,0:28:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I cast away this Heaven's mandate?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.02,0:28:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.30,0:28:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your aspirations are understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.50,0:28:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am but a mere peasant, inadequate to discuss such great matters with the Emperor's uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.98,0:28:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you have asked, I can only answer impromptu.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.42,0:28:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I receive your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.82,0:28:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wonder where Sir Kongming has gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.62,0:29:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am also visiting Sir Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.38,0:29:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, shall we go to Xinye together?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.26,0:29:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been a free spirit for so long, \NI have no need for making a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.86,0:29:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your intentions, I hope to meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.94,0:29:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't see Kongming, instead saw \Nan egghead! What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.94,0:29:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were the words of \Na hermit... A hermit indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.18,0:29:50.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}The warrior has yet to \Nmake a name for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.26,0:29:55.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Alas! For he hasn't met a sagacious lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.90,0:29:58.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Come! Another cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.42,0:30:06.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}The warrior has yet to \Nmake a name for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.50,0:30:12.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Alas! For he hasn't met his sagacious lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.50,0:30:20.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,695.454)}{\bord12.545}Don't you see, the sage is alone with the wine in a remote valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.50,0:30:31.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}With whom can he discuss \Ngovernance and statecraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of training troops in the winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.78,0:30:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we're trudging here to meet with some braggart!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.98,0:30:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This cold will harm Elder Brother's health.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.10,0:30:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we return to Xinye?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want Kongming to know my sincerity. \NIf Third Brother is afraid of the cold, you may return.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.58,0:30:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go ahead with Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.42,0:30:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not afraid of death, let alone the cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.58,0:31:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't want Elder Brother to waste his effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.78,0:31:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.30,0:31:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, look! There's an inn there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.30,0:31:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the place for a drink to warm ourselves up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.66,0:31:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.10,0:31:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Have another!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.50,0:31:34.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}People speak of the history long past;
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.90,0:31:39.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}the valiant soaring eagle\N crowns the military officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.10,0:31:46.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}For my life, I only have \Naspirations for the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.10,0:31:58.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Who is willing to comment on the heroes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.42,0:32:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644.005,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Brilliant! What a brilliant song!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.18,0:32:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be another song by Sir Wolong!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.82,0:32:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Third brother, have some wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.58,0:32:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in, come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.18,0:32:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.78,0:32:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask who among you is Sir Wolong?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.46,0:32:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? What are you seeking Mister Sleeping Dragon for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:50.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(366.263,254.692)}Shi \NGuangyuan
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.42,0:32:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Liu Bei and would like to visit Mister Wolong,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.58,0:32:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to ask for methods to cure the world and help the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.86,0:33:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all friends of Mister Wolong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.38,0:33:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am {\i1}Shi Guangyuan{\i0} from Yingchuan, this is {\i1}Meng Gongwei{\i0} from Runan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.02,0:33:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're nearly frozen, and we still haven't seen Kongming!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.94,0:33:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother, let's be on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.30,0:33:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long heard of your great name, what a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.26,0:33:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have horses here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.50,0:33:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,May I invite you to visit Sleeping Dragon's Retreat for a chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.42,0:33:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We are mere peasants of the mountains and know nothing of state affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.70,0:33:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to be bothered with.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.18,0:33:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir should mount your horse and seek Wolong yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.98,0:33:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go ahead, as you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.50,0:33:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disturb, please continue drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.38,0:33:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What arrogant men, and Elder Brother still wants to treat them with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.22,0:33:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.22,0:33:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, you lower yourself too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.82,0:34:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If we are the kind to forsake strategy and just fight at the command table,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.58,0:34:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,, how can we secure the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.62,0:34:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Innkeeper, innkeeper! Bring the wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.78,0:34:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.62,0:34:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.30,0:34:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.18,0:35:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,, I accompany you through hell or high waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.42,0:35:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I only ask you to not suffer this kind of misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.22,0:35:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your good intentions, my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.90,0:35:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But do both of you know what's in my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.90,0:35:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the aid of a sage man, how can we fulfill the vows we swore?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.90,0:35:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What great cause is there to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.30,0:35:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In terms of valor, no one can match you two and Zilong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.82,0:35:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, we have suffered continuous defeat all these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.54,0:35:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,roaming here and there without any firm foothold.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.14,0:36:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As Shuijing said, it was because we had no wise men to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.66,0:36:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother, say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.26,0:36:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be on our way after this cup of wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.58,0:37:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongming! Kongming! Are you at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.30,0:37:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear third brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.10,0:37:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.50,0:37:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.46,0:37:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.98,0:37:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your teacher here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.90,0:37:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher is reading in his room, please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.30,0:38:12.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}"The phoenix soars high, and won't perch on anything other than a parasol."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.42,0:38:21.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}"The scholar is hidden somewhere and won't follow anyone other than his lord."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.42,0:38:29.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}"While he is content with tilling his fields, how I love my hut."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.42,0:38:39.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}"For now, he is above the qin and books, waiting for the right time."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.74,0:38:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have longed to meet you, but haven't had the fate to do so earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.62,0:38:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Since Teacher Shuijing and Xu Yuanzhi has recommended you many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.90,0:38:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we came to visit your retreat, but had to return when you weren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.82,0:39:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we have braved the snow and storm, and it is our great fortune to see your noble face.

